meaning of coffee shop {
    Barista presents the menu to the user then accept the menu choice from the user.
    if the user selected coffee, then add coffee to cart.
    if the user selected bagel, then add bagel to cart.
    if the user terminated the transaction, then clear the cart and return to the menu.
    if the user proceeded with the payment, then process payment.
}

meaning of accept menu choice from the user {
    accept terminal input and store in menu_choice.
}

meaning of Barista presents the menu to the user {
    get formatted menu then display in terminal.
}

meaning of the user selected coffee {
    menu_choice equals "coffee".
}

meaning of the user selected bagel {
    menu_choice equals "bagel".
}

meaning of the user terminated the transaction {
    menu_choice equals "terminate".
}

meaning of the user proceeded with the payment {
    menu_choice equals "checkout".
}
